      "orig": "   IANA has made the following assignment in the \"TLS ExtensionType\n   Values\" registry:\n\n      +=======+================+=========+=============+===========+\n      | Value | Extension Name | TLS 1.3 | Recommended | Reference |\n      +=======+================+=========+=============+===========+\n      |    59 | dnssec_chain   | CH      | No          | RFC 9102  |\n      +-------+----------------+---------+-------------+-----------+",
      "correct": "   IANA has made the following assignment in the \"TLS ExtensionType\n   Values\" registry:\n\n      +=======+================+=========+=============+===========+\n      | Value | Extension Name | TLS 1.3 | Recommended | Reference |\n      +=======+================+=========+=============+===========+\n      |    59 | dnssec_chain   | CH, CT  | No          | RFC 9102  |\n      +-------+----------------+---------+-------------+-----------+",
      "notes": "In TLS1.3, the dnssec_chain extension appears in the Certificate message from the server. Hence \"CT\" needs to be added to the \"TLS 1.3\" column."
